OL,3,GNEWSAPatient dies after fall from
OL,4,Ahospital's 11th floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FHumberside Police are investigating
OL,7,Fevents leading to the death of a
OL,8,Fpatient who fell from an 11th-floor
OL,9,Fwindow at Hull Royal Infirmary.
OL,11,FThe 64-year-old man fell from a part of
OL,12,Fthe tower block where neurology and
OL,13,Fstroke patients are usually cared for.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the force said a
OL,16,Fdedicated team was conducting "complex"
OL,17,Fand "extensive" inquiries into the
OL,18,Fincident on 24 August.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
