OL,3,GNEWSAPatient dies after fall from
OL,4,Ahospital's 11th floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull University Teaching Hospitals NHS
OL,7,FTrust, which runs the hospital, said it
OL,8,Fwas unable to comment while the police
OL,9,Finvestigation was active.
